  "name": "Web Recon \u2014 Read the Headers",
  "value": 300,
  "description": "\ud83d\udcd6 Scenario\r\n\r\nWeb servers communicate more than just the visible webpage.\r\n\r\nHTTP response headers can reveal useful information about the server, infrastructure, and security configuration.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfaf Mission\r\n\r\nInspect the HTTP response headers of:\r\n\r\n[Flag1.cgcybercom.online](Flag1.cgcybercom.online)\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfaf Objective\r\n\r\nIdentify the information exposed through the server's HTTP headers.\r\n\r\nSubmit only the required answer using the flag format: pcgCTF{answer}",
